  "question": {
    "text": "The coordinates of the points on the line&nbsp;<math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> which are equidistant from the lines <math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> can be",
    "image": null
  },
